18:T413,In the heart of Australia’s tropical capital city is where you will find the luxurious and spacious Argus Apartments, Darwin - perfectly located moments from Darwin Waterfront Precinct, the bustling foodie haven of Mitchell Street, and the city’s unmissable attractions. Be sure to grab a bite at one of the many exceptional Asian-influenced restaurants and cafés, venture to Mindil Beach Sunset Markets, or visit the many museums and galleries, and delve deeper into Aboriginal culture, history, and traditions. Leave it all behind for the day and explore Litchfield National Park’s magnetic termite mounds, thundering waterfalls, monsoon rainforests, and historic sacred sites. After a day of exploration, take a refreshing dip in the property’s outdoor pool or unwind in your self-contained apartment. Apartments offer a full kitchen with modern appliances, artwork from local creators, comfortable furnishings, and a generous balcony for alfresco dining - perfect for couples, groups, or families seeking an escape in the Top End.13:["$","div",null,{"className":"main-content","children":["$","$L17",null,{"hotels":[{"vendor_name":"Argus Apartments","offer_country_name":"Australia","location_heading":"Darwin","title":"Darwin Spacious Self-Contained Apartments Minutes from Waterfront Precinct","description":"$18","location_subheading":"Australia","price":301,"original_price":301,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/0062y000006Pm6VAAS","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/b9vhuq4aq3q7dsuimn6","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/2j5ghpde6sm1jfzb88k","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/0ayvsf4c1tpvevyjxuwc","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2026-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Rydges Darwin Central","offer_country_name":"Australia","location_heading":"Darwin","title":"Modern Retreat in Heart of Darwin CBD near Harbour Esplanade","description":"Experience a vibrant mix of coastal and city life at the relaxed Rydges Darwin Central, perfectly positioned in the heart of the CBD. Only a short distance from the palm-fringed harbour esplanade, the hotel is conveniently located among local waterfront attractions and opposite boutique stores - the ideal launchpad for a sunny Darwin escape. Venture out to explore historic monuments and WWII sites, or take a day trip to Litchfield or Kakadu National Parks, just a few hours away.","location_subheading":"Australia","price":72,"original_price":72,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/0062y00000BeLivAAF","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/7yqeg9a23a7rcp5b6us6","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/zonw41v7wak6nu2jejba","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/13tj4ic8ugcs4lqbpdou","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2026-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"H on Mitchell Apartment Hotel","offer_country_name":"Australia","location_heading":"Darwin","title":"Contemporary Darwin City Self-Contained Stay with Rooftop Pool, Restaurant & Bar","description":"Experience the vibrancy of Darwin from this contemporary self-contained stay. Located in the heart of the city, this modern retreat offers a rooftop pool with city views, a fully equipped gym and an onsite sports bar. Savour the flavours of the Northern Territory at the hotel's restaurant, Lizards Bar and Restaurant, or venture out to explore the bustling Mitchell Street, lined with bars, eateries and shops. When you're ready for adventure, the stunning Litchfield National Park is just over an hour's drive away.","location_subheading":"Australia","price":72,"original_price":72,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/006Ii000002HkRaIAK","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/iseiqs7nlbko0i8uoqwe","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/rf3viwl7b8vgbqqi51me","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/l57xna9zjamio5orry9","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2050-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Ramada Suites by Wyndham Zen Quarter Darwin","offer_country_name":"Australia","location_heading":"Darwin","title":"Top-Rated Central Darwin Self-Contained Apartments","description":"For a perfect city escape that's only a stone's throw from Darwin's CBD and waterfront precinct, look no further than Ramada Suites by Wyndham Zen Quarter Darwin, ranked within the top 10% of properties on Tripadvisor. Located just 550 metres from the centre of the city, you're perfectly positioned to explore Darwin's cultural curiosities and outdoor adventures - including Crocosaurus Cove, home to the world’s largest display of Australian reptiles, less than a 15-minute walk away. Further afield, discover the UNESCO World Heritage-listed Kakadu National Park and Litchfield National Park, and when you return, enjoy the use of a rooftop café overlooking the leafy streets below, or take a dip in the 28-metre saltwater infinity pool, the perfect way to relax after a day exploring this incredible part of the world.","location_subheading":"Australia","price":94,"original_price":94,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/0062y000008fSM6AAM","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/lq2yx35ug4fvfknmxnqp","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/dp1i9s9qu2ijb8z4lcm","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/dl2mc2w6jfuls8pfm3p","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 2","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2026-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Mantra on the Esplanade","offer_country_name":"Australia","location_heading":"Darwin","title":"Waterfront Escape in Heart of Darwin with Harbour Views & Outdoor Pool","description":"Immerse yourself in the vibrant heart of Darwin with a stay at this convenient waterfront property with stunning views. This urban retreat offers panoramic vistas of the harbour, and is close to the city's shopping precinct and the historic Stokes Hill Wharf. Sample regional flavours with restaurants and cafes at your doorstep and take a relaxed stroll to nearby Mindil Beach Sunset Market. For a touch of history, the Museum and Art Gallery of the Northern Territory is just a short drive away.","location_subheading":"Australia","price":92,"original_price":92,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/0062y00000JReupAAD","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/dbrqgj25de6xqcqu2pva","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/msxvx36dcke517wp3r","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/x9y9tweyt64qzid48qwsv","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2050-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Adina Apartment Hotel Darwin Waterfront","offer_country_name":"Australia","location_heading":"Darwin","title":"Darwin Studio Apartment Stay Along the Waterfront","description":"Stay at the gateway to Australia's Top End at Adina Apartment Hotel Darwin Waterfront, perfectly positioned along the capital's promenade with vibrant restaurants and popular city sights at your fingertips. The hotel's studios and apartments ensure a home-away-from-home feel, coupled with the excitement of exploring a new city. Between exploring Darwin and its surrounds, enjoy a meal at the onsite Curve Restaurant and Bar or cool off with a dip in the pool.","location_subheading":"Australia","price":129,"original_price":129,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/0062y000009DMhgAAG","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/nei9o2g03npqa7bhhe4m","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/b3cdrll1ej9ktqu0pxz","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/tq7c4fuemnu0craz5e","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2026-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Mercure Darwin Airport Resort","offer_country_name":"Australia","location_heading":"Darwin","title":"Tropical Darwin Escape Near the Airport with Lagoon-Style Pool & Poolside Restaurant","description":"Lose yourself in the tropical allure of Australia's Top End with a stay at this delightful resort. Just moments from Darwin International Airport, this modern oasis is your gateway to the region's rich Indigenous heritage, stunning national parks and vibrant food scene. Sit back and enjoy the tropical landscaping, take a dip in the lagoon-style pool, or tuck into the Territory's famous barramundi at Cossies Poolside Bar and Bistro. When it's time to explore, the city centre of Darwin is just 15 minutes away. Head to the bustling Mindil Beach Sunset Market, savour fresh seafood at the waterfront precinct or marvel at the region's unique wildlife at Crocosaurus Cove.","location_subheading":"Australia","price":90,"original_price":90,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/006Ii000002J2vzIAC","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/bz9hukg5jpa309o6hh2u","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/jmu7e9qeskxinf50sbo8","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/sl1op4m0ihjx3bjhcr2","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2050-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Novotel Darwin CBD","offer_country_name":"Australia","location_heading":"Darwin","title":"Waterfront Retreat in Darwin CBD with Outdoor Pool & Onsite Dining","description":"Located in Darwin's dynamic cityscape, this property offers all the comfort you need with the city right on your doorstep. It's a quick wander to the Darwin Waterfront Precint, where you can sip, shop and savour breathtaking views of the Timor Sea. Head to the Darwin Sailing Club, one of the best places in town to watch the sunset while enjoying a cold drink. Relax in the Novotel Darwin CBD's spacious rooms with modern amenities, including a cool outdoor pool to beat the tropical heat. Whether you’re unwinding after a day of exploring the nearby Mindil Beach Markets or gearing up for an evening of leisure in the CBD, you’ll find everything you need for a memorable stay in the heart of this city.","location_subheading":"Australia","price":84,"original_price":84,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/006Ii000002IlvqIAC","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/7w6y578hpsljdxb2tyu5","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/oxv7fuedsh4a0mllp79x","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/arkwi2cmbmn1rgpdu69w","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2050-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Novotel Darwin Airport","offer_country_name":"Australia","location_heading":"Darwin","title":"Convenient Darwin Airport Stay 15 Minutes from CBD with Three Restaurants & Swimming Pool","description":"Discover a new standard of airport accommodation at Novotel Darwin Airport. Unwind by the outdoor lap pool, savour delicious all-day dining at Splash Cafe, or toast to your travels at the stylish Cossie's Poolside Bar and Bistro. Located a short drive from Darwin CBD, this hotel is an ideal launchpad for the famous Mindil Beach Sunset Markets or the natural wonders of Berry Springs. Business travellers appreciate close acess to business districts, while leisure guests can discover nearby shopping at Casuarina Square.","location_subheading":"Australia","price":95,"original_price":95,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/006Ii000002J2xoIAC","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/ltcws9cy8vzhqw3d5rlb","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/3njkgaes1utv4hodsxg","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/0veg23fehc61a0g4fzzl","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2050-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Oaks Darwin Elan Hotel","offer_country_name":"Australia","location_heading":"Darwin","title":"Contemporary Darwin City Break Overlooking the Harbour","description":"For a city escape that's only a stone's throw from Darwin's CBD and waterfront precinct, look no further than Oaks Darwin Elan Hotel. The contemporary hotel is perfectly positioned to explore Darwin's dining, entertaining and shopping hubs, sitting near Crocosaurus Cove and Smith Street Mall. After a day of discovering the Territory, sample local flavours at The O.A.K Restaurant or relax with a dip in the outdoor pool.","location_subheading":"Australia","price":91,"original_price":91,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/0062y000009BTkfAAG","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/6gagyr9d6osvn54gorm","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/51eg8eji18hoho47ps1a","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/z48ev76gcnp2r08iysdr","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2026-12-31 12:59:00"}],"lang":"en"}]}]
